Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.58,0:01:19.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Can I hide out here for a while? -Sure. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.58,0:01:19.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我能在这里躲一下子吗？ -没问题 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.58,0:01:22.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there's this girl I know from back in Nebraska, Christy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.58,0:01:22.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在内布拉斯加认识一个女生 她叫克里斯蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:25.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She called me up, she's like, "Hey, how's California?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:25.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她打电话跟我说“加州还好吧？”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:27.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm like, "Awesome," because it's not Nebraska.
