Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.14,0:01:41.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...yakking about every guy she slept with in Omaha, which is every guy in Omaha...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.14,0:01:41.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大谈在奥马哈跟她上过床的男人 那等于是奥马哈所有的男人
