Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:33.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你们需要第四个人 我跟你们玩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:36.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Great idea. -Uh, no.
