Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:16.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoever's her partner will be hamstrung by her lack of experience, not to mention--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:17.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她的搭档得弥补 她的经验不足 更别提…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:17.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[EXPLOSION ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:19.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha-ha! There goes your head again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:19.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的头又被爆掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:23.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, it's not good sportsmanship to shoot somebody who's just re-spawned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 那真的很有风度 攻击刚刚复活的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:25.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You need to give them a chance to-- Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.80,0:04:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得给他们机会…喂 少来！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:26.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[EXPLOSION ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.10,0:04:29.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj, Raj, she's got me cornered. Cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.10,0:04:29.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 她把我堵住了 掩护我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.19,0:04:31.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cover this, suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.19,0:04:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看我的 废物们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHUCKLING]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:33.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, you are on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:33.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 你势头真猛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:36.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, and so is Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.94,0:04:36.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 谢尔顿身上的火烧得也很猛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.23,0:04:37.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:40.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, that's it. I don't know how, but she is cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:40.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}够了 我不知道是怎么一回事 但她在作弊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:44.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No one can be that attractive and this skilled at a video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:44.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有人能长得这么漂亮 又这么会打游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:46.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, Sheldon, come back. You forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:46.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 谢尔顿 你忘了东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This plasma grenade.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:50.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个电浆手榴弹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:51.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[EXPLOSION ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha! Look, it's raining you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快看 天在下“谢尔顿雨”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:04:59.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You laugh now, you just wait until you need tech support.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:04:59.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}笑吧 你需要技术支援时就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:03.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gosh. He's kind of a sore loser, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:03.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 他真的很输不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.60,0:05:07.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, to be fair, he's also a rather unpleasant winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.60,0:05:07.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说句公道话 他赢的时候也很没有风度
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:09.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's been fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:09.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这真的很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.27,0:05:11.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, we make such a good team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.27,0:05:11.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我们是天生一对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.23,0:05:14.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we could enter a couple of "Halo" tournaments sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.23,0:05:14.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许有空时 我们可以参加《光晕》双打赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:17.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or we could just have a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:17.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是出门享受生活
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:20.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess for you, that's an option. Ha-ha. Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:20.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想对你来说那是个好选项
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:22.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Good night, Leonard. -Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:22.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-晚安 莱纳德 -晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:25.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As usual, nice talking to you, Raj.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:25.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一如既往 很高兴跟你聊天 拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:28.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you suppose she meant by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:28.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得她是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:31.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's an enigma, Raj.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:31.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是个谜 拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:35.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a certain ethic to the game, Penny, a well-established--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:35.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个游戏是有道德准则的 佩妮 大家都知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:37.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's gone, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:37.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她已经走了 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, she could have said goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她该跟我说再见的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:43.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:43.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我有个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:46.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's called carpal tunnel syndrome, and quite frankly, you deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:46.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那叫做腕隧道症候群 老实说你活该
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:49.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:49.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:55.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, um, Howard and Christy are kind of hooking up in my bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:55.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德跟克里斯蒂 在我的卧室里上床
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you sure? -Look, I grew up on a farm, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你确定？ -听着 我在农场长大
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:06:02.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}From what I heard, they're either having sex or Howard's caught in a milking machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:06:02.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从听到的声音判断 他们不是在做爱 就是霍华德被挤奶器卷进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:07.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you mind if I stay here tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:07.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚我能待在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:10.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Yeah, take the couch, or my bed. I just got new pillows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:10.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}行 你可以睡沙发或我的床 我刚买了新枕头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:13.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hypoallergenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:13.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}低敏枕头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:15.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, the couch is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我睡沙发就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:17.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold that thought. Leonard, a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:17.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 过来聊一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:23.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have a problem with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:23.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来猜猜看 你有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.22,0:06:24.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where do I begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.22,0:06:24.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该从哪里说起呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:27.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's up to you. Crazy person's choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:27.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}由你决定 疯子有选择权
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.43,0:06:29.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, first, we don't have house guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.43,0:06:29.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首先 我们不留客人过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:33.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Frankly, if I could afford the rent, I'd ask you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:33.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老实说 如果我负担得起房租 我会请你离开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.73,0:06:36.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your friendship means a lot to me as well. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.73,0:06:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的友谊对我来说也很重要 还有呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:39.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, our earthquake supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:39.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的地震备用品
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:41.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We have a two-man, two-day kit. -So?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:41.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们买了双人两天份 -所以呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So if there's an earthquake and the three of us are trapped here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以如果发生地震 我们三个被困在这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:48.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we could be out of food by tomorrow afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:48.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明天下午我们就没有食物吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:51.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you suggesting that if we let Penny stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:51.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说如果佩妮留下来…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.45,0:06:53.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we might succumb to cannibalism?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.45,0:06:53.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可能得吃人肉？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:56.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No one ever thinks it'll happen until it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:56.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁都不知道会发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:07:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, if you promise not to chew the flesh off our bones while we sleep, you can stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:07:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 只要你发誓不会趁我们睡觉时 啃我们的肉跟骨头你就能留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.21,0:07:08.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Ha. What? -He's engaging in reductio ad absurdum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.21,0:07:08.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -他是在使用归谬法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:12.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the fallacy of extending someone's argument to ridiculous proportions...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:12.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是谬误的推理 延伸某人的论点直至荒谬的地步
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:15.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and then criticizing the result. And I don't appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:15.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后再批评其结论 我非常不欣赏你的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:19.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll get you a blanket and a pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:19.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我帮你拿毯子跟枕头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:23.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, since I'm obviously being ignored here, let's go over the morning schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:23.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然没有人理我 我们来谈早上的时间安排
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:26.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I use the bathroom from 7 to 7:20.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.78,0:07:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}七点到七点二十分 我会用浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.49,0:07:28.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plan your ablutions and bodily functions accordingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.49,0:07:28.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请根据这个原则 计划你的梳洗及身体功能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:32.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How am I supposed to plan my bodily functions?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:32.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么计划我的身体功能？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I suggest no liquids after 11 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.91,0:07:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我建议晚上十一点后 别饮用流质食物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:38.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Here you go. -Thanks, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:38.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拿去吧 -谢谢你 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.88,0:07:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heh, wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.88,0:07:42.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}错了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在听
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.01,0:07:48.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your head goes on the other end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.01,0:07:48.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的头得朝向另一边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:50.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -It's culturally universal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:50.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -这是文化共通的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:52.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A bed, even a temporary bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:52.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}床 即使是临时铺的床
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:55.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is always oriented with the headboard away from the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:55.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}床头绝对不能朝门
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:59.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It serves the ancient imperative of protecting oneself against marauders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:59.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那源自于古老的规则 要保护自己不被抢劫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:04.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'll risk it. -Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:04.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我愿意冒这个险
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:06.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anything else I should know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:06.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有什么事是我该知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:10.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. If you use my toothbrush, I'll jump out that window.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:10.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你用我的牙刷 我会从那扇窗户跳下去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.95,0:08:14.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please don't come to my funeral. Have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.95,0:08:14.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请不要来参加我的葬礼 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:19.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sorry about that. -That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:19.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的很抱歉 -没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}FYI, his toothbrush is the red one in the Plexiglas case under the UV light.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 他的牙刷是红色那把 放在紫外线灯下的树脂塑胶杯里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:27.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Ha. Got it. -Well, sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:27.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-知道了 -好好睡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:29.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:29.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:35.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Funny expression, sleep tight. Ha-ha. Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:35.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常有趣的说法 好好睡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:38.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It refers to the early construction of beds...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:38.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是因为早期的床铺结构
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:42.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which featured a mattress suspended on interlocking ropes, which occasionally--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:42.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是将床垫悬空放在交错的绳子上 偶尔会…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.61,0:08:45.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sleep tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.61,0:08:45.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好好睡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:08.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every Saturday since we've lived in this apartment I have awakened at 6:15...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:08.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自从我们搬进这里后每个星期六 我都会在早上六点十五分醒来…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.90,0:10:11.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...poured a bowl of cereal, added a quarter cup of milk...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.90,0:10:11.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}加四分之一杯的脱脂牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:16.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...sat on this end of this couch, turned on BBC America, and watched Doctor Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:16.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坐在这张沙发的这一端 看BBC美国台的《神秘博士》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:18.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny's still sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:18.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮还在睡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:22.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every Saturday since we've lived in this apartment...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:22.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自从我们搬进这里后 每个星期六…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I have awakened at 6:15, poured myself--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会在早上六点十五分醒来 帮自己倒…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:26.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. Look, you have a TV in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:26.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 听着 你房间里有电视
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:28.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you have breakfast in bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.96,0:10:28.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不躺在床上吃早餐？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I am neither an invalid nor a woman celebrating Mother's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我不是废物 也不是庆祝母亲节的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:36.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:36.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}几点了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.47,0:10:38.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Almost 6:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.47,0:10:38.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大约六点半
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:40.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I slept all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:40.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我睡了一整天？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's 6:30 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:42.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 是早上六点半
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:45.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:45.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们到底有什么毛病？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, this cereal has lost all its molecular integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 这碗早餐麦片 失去了它分子的完整性
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:52.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I now have a bowl of shredded wheat paste.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:52.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我得吃麦片糊了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:56.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hola, nerd-migos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家好 书呆子朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:11:00.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do you people hate sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:11:00.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么你们讨厌睡觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:03.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you wearing my robe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:03.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你穿着我的睡袍？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. Sorry, I'll have it cleaned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 抱歉 我会把它洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:09.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's okay, keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:09.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系 你留着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where's Christy? -In the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-克里斯蒂呢？ -她在浴室里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:15.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, where did you get that loofah mitt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:15.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 你的沐浴手套在哪里买的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yours reaches places that mine just won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:18.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的手套能够清洁到 我的手套够不着的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:24.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You used my loofah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:24.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你用了我的沐浴手套？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:27.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}More precisely, we used your loofah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:27.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该说我们用了你的沐浴手套
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:29.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I exfoliated her brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:29.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她被我刷得爽爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:33.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can keep that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:33.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个你也可以留着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:38.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah. Well, then, we'll probably need to talk about your stuffed-bear collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:38.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我们该谈谈你收集的小熊娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHRISTY: Howard? -In here, milady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德 -来了 美女
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:47.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm. There's my little engine that could.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.33,0:11:47.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的小火车头在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.71,0:11:49.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IMITATING TRAIN]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:54.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's one beloved children's book I'll never read again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:54.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再也不会看那本儿童书了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.05,0:11:57.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. Christy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.05,0:11:57.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 我是克里斯蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:58.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Leonard. -I'm Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:58.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 -我是谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.01,0:12:01.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right. You're Howard's entourage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.01,0:12:01.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 你们是霍华德的跟班
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, Christy, what are your plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里斯蒂 你有什么计划？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.81,0:12:09.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, Howard said he'd take me shopping in Beverly Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.81,0:12:09.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德说他要带我到比弗利山庄购物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:13.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, no, I meant plans to find someplace to live other than with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:13.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我是说找地方搬走 别住在我家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not that I don't love having you, but it's a little crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是不喜欢跟你一起住 但那真的有点挤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:18.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, you're always welcome to stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:18.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我们随时欢迎你跟我们一起住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.66,0:12:21.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, terrific. Now we're running a cute little B &amp; B.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.66,0:12:21.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了 现在我们开始经营温馨民宿了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:24.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me offer a little thinking here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:24.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想提供一点意见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:27.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why doesn't Christy stay with me? -You live with your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:27.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-克里斯蒂 你何不跟我住？ -首先 你跟你妈住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:30.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do not. My mother lives with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:30.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才不是 是我妈跟我住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:35.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's settled. Christy will stay with Howard, Penny can go back to her apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:35.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就这么说定了 克里斯蒂跟霍华德住 佩妮搬回她的公寓住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.34,0:12:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'll watch the last 24 minutes of Doctor Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.34,0:12:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要看剩下的 24分钟的《神秘博士》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.92,0:12:41.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...although at this point, it's more like Doctor Why Bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.92,0:12:41.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然现在变成了《还看什么看博士》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:45.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, you just can't dictate-- -No more talking. Everybody go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 你不能决… -别说了 大家离开
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:50.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what do you say? Wanna repair to Casa Wolowitz?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:50.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得怎么样？ 要把沃洛维茨堡修好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.48,0:12:53.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is that, like a Mexican deli?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.48,0:12:53.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是什么？墨西哥快餐店吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.19,0:12:55.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, I should have mentioned this earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.19,0:12:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 我该事先跟你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:12:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My last name is Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:12:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我姓沃洛维茨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:13:00.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:13:00.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那真的很酷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:02.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My first Jew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:02.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我第一个犹太男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:09.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I imagine there aren't very many kosher cornhuskers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想内布拉斯加州犹太人应该不多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:14.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-But you're still taking me shopping? -Anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:14.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你还是会带我去购物 对吧？ -你想买什么都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:16.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'll go pack my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:16.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我去打包行李
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:22.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When they perfect human cloning, I'm gonna order 12 of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:22.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果人类克隆可以完美实现 我一定要订购12个她
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.85,0:13:26.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, can't you see she's using you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.85,0:13:26.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 你看不出来她在利用你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:30.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who cares? Last night, she pulled off her blouse and I wept.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:30.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁在乎呢？ 昨晚她脱掉上衣时我哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.27,0:13:31.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, Howard, I know her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.27,0:13:31.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 霍华德 我了解她 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She'll have sex with anyone as long as they keep buying her things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁肯买东西给她 她就跟谁上床
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:37.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:37.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的吗？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.57,0:13:38.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you'll excuse me, I have some bar mitzvah bonds to cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 我得把 成年礼债券拿去换现金
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.21,0:13:56.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, we cannot do this without Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.21,0:13:56.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起 沃洛维茨不在 我们不能这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:59.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We can't order Chinese food without Wolowitz?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:59.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}沃洛维茨不在 我们就不能点中国菜？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:00.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me walk you through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:00.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得跟你解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:03.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our standard order is, the steamed dumpling appetizer...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:03.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的标准菜单是蒸饺做开胃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.72,0:14:05.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...General Tso's chicken, beef with broccoli...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.72,0:14:05.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}左宗棠鸡跟芥兰牛肉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.01,0:14:08.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...shrimp with lobster sauce, and vegetable lo mein.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.01,0:14:08.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}龙虾汁烩虾仁加蔬菜捞面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you see the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看到问题出在哪里了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.93,0:14:13.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I see a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.93,0:14:13.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的确看到一个问题人物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:17.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our entire order is predicated on four dumplings and four entrées...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:17.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的点菜模式 包括了四个饺子跟四道主菜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...divided amongst four people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}平分给四个人吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.19,0:14:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So we'll just order three entrées.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.19,0:14:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我们可以只点三道主菜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.53,0:14:26.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. What do you wanna eliminate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.53,0:14:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你要淘汰哪一道？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-And who gets the extra dumpling? -We could cut it into thirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谁吃多余的饺子？ -我们可以均分成三份
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.37,0:14:30.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then it's no longer a dumpling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.37,0:14:30.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就不算是饺子了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:34.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Once you cut it open, it is, at best, a very small open-faced sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:34.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把它切开后 那顶多是单面小三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.25,0:14:36.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.25,0:14:36.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:41.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Where's your annoying little friend who thinks he speaks Mandarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:41.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们那个自以为会说中文的 烦人朋友在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:43.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's putting his needs ahead of the collective good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他将个人私欲摆在集体利益之前
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:46.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where he comes from, that's punishable by death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:46.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在他的家乡 那可是会被判死刑的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:49.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I come from Sacramento.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:49.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我来自萨克拉门托
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:56.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can we get an order of dumplings, but with three instead of four?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:56.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们能点一份饺子吗？ 但只要三个而不是四个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No substitutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:57.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能替换
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This isn't a substitution. It's a reduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是替换 这是减量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.61,0:15:03.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. No reductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.61,0:15:03.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 不能减量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.78,0:15:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. Bring us three orders of dumplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.78,0:15:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 给我们三份饺子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:08.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's 12, we'll each have four. -That works.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:08.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-一共十二个 每个人吃四个 -好方法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.07,0:15:11.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we fill up on dumplings, we need to eliminate an entrée.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.07,0:15:11.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 点这么多饺子 我们就得再淘汰一道主菜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:12.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No eliminations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:12.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能淘汰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:16.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we have extra, we'll just take the leftovers home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:16.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多出来的可以打包回家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:20.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And divide it how? I'm telling you, we cannot do this without Wolowitz.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.96,0:15:20.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那该怎么分呢？ 我说过沃洛维茨不在是行不通的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:22.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wolowitz is with his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:22.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}沃洛维茨跟他的新女朋友在一起 如果你让我邀请佩妮来…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.38,0:15:25.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you'd let me invite Penny, you would've had your fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.38,0:15:26.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-就有第四个人了 -你看过佩妮吃中国菜吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:26.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you seen Penny eat Chinese food?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:29.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She uses a fork and she double-dips her egg rolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:29.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她用叉子吃 咬过春卷后还去蘸酱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.80,0:15:33.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We don't order egg rolls. -Exactly. But we'd have to if she was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.80,0:15:33.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们不点春卷 -没错 但她来的话就得点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:34.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can we please make a decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:34.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们能快点决定吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.98,0:15:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not only are there children starving in India, there's an Indian starving right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.98,0:15:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不只在印度有小孩要饿死 在这里就有印度人要饿死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:43.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's an idea. Why don't we go out for Indian food?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:44.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是个好点子 我们干脆去吃印度菜吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:44.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, ew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:46.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're nice boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:46.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们都是好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.99,0:15:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell you what I'm going to do. I'm gonna bring you the four dumplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.99,0:15:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就这么办吧 我会给你们四个饺子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:52.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I'm walking over to the table...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:52.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我走过去的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:55.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...maybe I get bumped, one of the dumplings fall to the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我会撞到 有一粒饺子会掉到地上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:56.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No one has to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:56.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有人会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:15:59.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.25,0:15:59.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:02.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKING IN CHINESE]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:07.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How about soup? -Yeah, we can always divide soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:07.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-汤呢？ -对 我们可以分汤喝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:09.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about the won tons?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:09.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那馄饨呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.81,0:16:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Hey, guys, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.81,0:16:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's "Halo" night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天是《光晕》之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:21.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:21.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:25.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.69,0:16:25.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:28.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With Wolowitz spending all of his time with your friend Christy--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:28.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}沃洛维茨跟你朋友 克里斯蒂黏在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:32.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's not my friend. Friends do not get their friends' Care Bears all sweaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:32.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不是我的朋友 朋友不会把朋友的熊宝宝弄得都是汗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:37.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right, anyway, uh, with Wolowitz occupied elsewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:37.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 沃洛维茨在别的地方忙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we had something we wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要请你帮个忙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:42.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon? -Yes. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:42.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 -是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:48.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, we would very much appreciate it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:48.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我们会非常感激你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.26,0:16:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if you would be the fourth member of our "Halo" team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.26,0:16:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你能成为 我们光晕团队的第四人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:55.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think I need to tell you what an honor this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:55.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你不需要我提醒你 那是多么大的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:16:59.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. That's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:16:59.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的好贴心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.48,0:17:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I'm going out dancing with a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.48,0:17:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我要跟闺蜜去跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.69,0:17:03.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't go out, it's "Halo" night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.69,0:17:03.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能出门 今天是《光晕》之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:06.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, for Penny, it's dancing night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:06.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对佩妮来说 这是跳舞之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.69,0:17:08.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You go dancing every Wednesday? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.69,0:17:08.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你每星期三都去跳舞吗？ -没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:10.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then it's not dancing night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:10.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么今天就不是跳舞之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.99,0:17:13.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't I play with you tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.99,0:17:13.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我们干脆明天再玩？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tonight is "Halo" night. It's like talking to a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天是《光晕》夜 这真的是对牛弹琴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:21.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, now, Sheldon, you and I are about to have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:21.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 谢尔顿 你我之间有问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:25.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, remember, we role-played this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:25.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 记住 我们之前已经情景模拟过了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:28.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but you didn't portray her as completely irrational.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:28.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 但你没演出她的荒谬无理
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:31.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, fellas, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.13,0:17:31.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 大伙儿们 我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:33.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:33.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你们好运
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.06,0:17:39.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we should've asked if we could go dancing with her and her girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.06,0:17:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我们该问 我们能不能跟她和她的朋友去跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:42.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, assuming we could dance, which we can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:42.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 假设我们会跳舞 事实上我们不会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.27,0:17:44.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...there are three of us and two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.27,0:17:44.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们有三个人 她们是两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:48.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? -It's the Chinese restaurant all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:48.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以呢？ -这是中国餐厅事件的重演
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:51.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I assure you that cutting a dumpling in thirds is child's play...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.78,0:17:51.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你保证 把饺子分成三等份是小事一桩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.94,0:17:56.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...compared with three men each attempting to dance with 67 percent of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.94,0:17:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相较于三个男人平均 只能跟67%的女人跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:18:00.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For God's sakes, Sheldon, you are driving me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:18:00.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 谢尔顿 我快被你逼疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:03.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your anger is not with me, but with mathematics.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:03.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是在生我的气 你是在生基础数学的气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:05.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm pretty sure my anger is with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:05.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我确定我在生你的气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:08.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is happening to us? We're falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:08.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是怎么了？我们的友谊快崩溃了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:12.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Who are you calling? -The only man who can restore...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:12.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要打电话给谁？ -唯一能让我们的宇宙…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:14.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...any semblance of balance to our universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:14.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恢复平衡的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD [ON RECORDING]: This is Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是霍华德沃洛维茨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHRISTY [ON RECORDING] This is Christy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是克里斯蒂范德贝特
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:22.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: We can't get to the phone right now because we're having sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:22.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不能接电话 因为我们在做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.31,0:18:26.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHRISTY: You're not gonna put that on your message, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.31,0:18:26.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不会在录音机里那么说吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.86,0:18:28.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: I'm just kidding. I'll re-record it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.86,0:18:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我是开玩笑的 我会重录
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.77,0:18:29.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.49,0:18:33.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, think this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.49,0:18:33.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你得想清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.99,0:18:36.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're going to ask Howard to choose between sex and "Halo."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.99,0:18:36.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要霍华德 在性跟《光晕》间做选择
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:40.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm going to ask him to choose between sex and "Halo 3."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:40.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我要他在性跟 《光晕3》间做选择
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:43.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As far as I know, sex has not been upgraded...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:43.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就我所知 性一直没有升级
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:46.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to include hi-def graphics and enhanced weapon systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:46.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以没有高清画面跟先进的武器系统
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:50.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right, all sex has is nudity, orgasms and human contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:50.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说的对 性只有赤裸、高潮跟身体接触
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:52.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:52.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那正是我的观点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:56.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHRISTY: I'm just saying you can take the damn plastic off the couch once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是说你偶尔可以把 塑料布从沙发拿下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:18:59.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Why, so you and Howard can hump on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:18:59.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？让你跟霍华德在上面乱搞？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.06,0:19:03.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Ladies, ladies, I'm sure there's a middle ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.06,0:19:03.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}女士们 我想这一定有折衷做法
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.52,0:19:05.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Shut up, Howard! CHRISTY: Shut up, Howard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.52,0:19:05.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-闭嘴 霍华德！ -闭嘴 霍华德！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:09.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: You guys talk. I'm gonna take my scooter out for a spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:09.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们慢慢谈 我要骑摩托车去兜风
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:11.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHRISTY: You happy? You drove your son out of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:11.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你开心了吧？你把你儿子逼出家门
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:13.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Why don't you stop butting in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:13.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么老是这么霸道？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:16.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you guys doing here? -It's "Halo" night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:16.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们来这里做什么？ -今天是《光晕》之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:18.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: He's not a man, he's a putz.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不是个男人 他是笨蛋 别那样跟我说话 拜金女
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.87,0:19:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And don't you take that tone with me, you gold digger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:23.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHRISTY: What'd you call me? MRS. WOLOWITZ: You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:23.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你叫我什么？ -你听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're barking up the wrong tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得告诉你 你惹错人了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:29.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because as long as you're around, Howard is out of the will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:29.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为只要有你在 我的遗嘱里就不会有霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.46,0:19:32.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}CHRISTY: You know what? I got better offers. I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.46,0:19:32.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗？我有更好的提议 我要离开了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: That's right. Go back to Babylon, you whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 回到巴比伦去吧 你这个臭婊子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.97,0:19:42.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So "Halo" night, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.97,0:19:42.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《光晕》之夜是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:47.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I thought she was the whore of Omaha. -Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:47.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为她是奥马哈的婊子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.90,0:19:52.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GUNFIRE ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, you got him in your sights. Fire! He's charging his plasma rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你抓到他了！ 他在给电浆来复枪装弹药！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.49,0:19:59.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I can't shoot now, I'm cloaking. -Now, Raj, kill Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.49,0:19:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不能射击 我在隐形状态 -好 拉吉 杀了谢尔顿！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.45,0:20:00.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.45,0:20:00.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看不到他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.66,0:20:03.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why they call it cloaking, dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.66,0:20:03.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以才叫做隐形状态 死人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:06.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Start throwing grenades. -I'm all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:06.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-开始丢手榴弹！ -我的用光了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys, my friends and I got tired of dancing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 我跟我的朋友们不想跳舞了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:11.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so we came over to have sex with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:11.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们想来跟你们做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:13.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, Raj, jump in the tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:13.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 跳进坦克里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.25,0:20:16.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We said no tanks. -There are no rules in hell.
