Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:25.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a sniper. Use your rocket launcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:25.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有狙击手 快使用火箭筒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.35,0:20:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All I've got is a needler and I'm all out of ammo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.35,0:20:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只有一枚刺针飞弹 我没有弹药了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.77,0:20:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And now you're out of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.77,0:20:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没命了
