Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.06,0:20:36.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why did you hit pause? -I thought I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.06,0:20:36.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你干嘛按暂停？ -我好像听到有人在说话
